{"info_box":"<div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12 ui-resizable\" data-type=\"container-content\"><div data-type=\"component-text\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 11px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>CHI B\u1ed8 \u0110\u1ea2NG CHEO REO<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>S\u01a1 l\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ecbch s\u1eed:<\/i><\/b> Chi b\u1ed9 \u0110\u1ea3ng \u1edf Cheo Reo \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp do \u0111\u1ed3ng ch\u00ed Ksor N\u00ed l\u00e0m B\u00ed th\u01b0. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 chi b\u1ed9 \u0110\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u1edf Cheo Reo. B\u1ea5y gi\u1edd, trong to\u00e0n huy\u1ec7n Cheo Reo \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 40 l\u00e0ng x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u01a1 s\u1edf c\u00e1ch m\u1ea1ng v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u l\u00e0ng ta \u0111\u00e3 n\u1eafm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ec1 trong t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 214 l\u00e0ng to\u00e0n t\u1ec9nh.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>\u0110\u01a1n v\u1ecb<\/i><\/b>: \u0110o\u00e0n x\u00e3 Ph\u00fa T\u00fac<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>C\u00e1n b\u1ed9 ph\u1ee5 tr\u00e1ch cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin<\/i><\/b>: Ksor H'Blang <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b><i>S\u0110T<\/i><\/b>:&nbsp;0329061508<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\